摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Local, offline speech-to-text for the DeepSeek Harness (dsh). Click the microphone in the composer, speak, and the recognized text is inserted into your draft — transcribed by a RapidSpeech.cpp rs-server running on your own machine. Audio never leaves your computer.","id":"gh:1449419504","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-rapidspeech","slug":"yoletPig/dsh-plugin-rapidspeech","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","funasr-nano","rapidspeech","sensevoice","x-asr"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Local, offline speech-to-text for the DeepSeek Harness (dsh). Click the microphone in the composer, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"speak, and the recognized text is inserted into your draft — transcribed by a RapidSpeech.cpp rs-ser"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ver running on your own machine. Audio never leaves your computer."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-rapidspeech"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Local, offline speech-to-text for the DeepSeek Harness (dsh). Click the microphone in the composer, "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"speak, and the recognized text is inserted into your draft — transcribed by a RapidSpeech.cpp `rs-se"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rver` running on your own machine. **Audio never leaves your computer.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Fully offline** — audio, model inference, and transcripts stay on this machine end to end.\n- **M"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"anaged server** — on first use, dsh downloads the `rs-server` binary and your chosen model, verifies"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" their integrity, spawns the server on a loopback port, and reclaims it after idle time. No manual s"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ervices.\n- **Model switching from the plugin page** — pick a model in the plugin's settings; it down"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"loads on the next recording and hot-swaps. Every downloaded model stays cached, so switching back is"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" instant.\n- **Curated model catalog** — X-ASR, SenseVoice, and FunASR-Nano from RapidAI's official m"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"irrors (ModelScope, HuggingFace, hf-mirror), each pinned to a SHA-256.\n- **Coexists with other provi"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"ders** — installs beside the official SenseVoice plugin; pick a provider per recording from the voic"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"e-input selector.\n- **External mode** — point the plugin at an `rs-server` you run yourself; the plu"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"gin then only connects and never manages it."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness **0.2.2 or newer** (npm CLI or Desktop app)\n- CPU with **AVX2** — Intel Haswell ("},{"id":"p8s2","text":"2013) / AMD Excavator (2015) or newer. Both the\nLinux and Windows builds target AVX2 as their baseli"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ne, so the requirement is\nidentical on either OS.\n- Disk: ~200 MB–1 GB per model; RAM: ~1–2 GB while"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" transcribing\n- Windows x64 and Linux x64"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### From the plugin marketplace (Desktop / Web UI)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Two ways — both put **RapidSpeech ASR (local)** in your plugin list:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Search and install** (simplest): open the market's install page, search for\n`dsh-plugin-rapidspe"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ech`, and install it. The package lives on the official npm\nregistry; if your npm mirror lags behind"},{"id":"p12s3","text":", give it a few minutes or point the\nregistry back at `registry.npmjs.org`.\n- **Index source** (cura"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ted card with a description): add this index URL in the\nmarket's index settings, then find **RapidSp"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"eech ASR (local)** and install:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### From the CLI"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Or install a specific release artifact without any build tooling:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Installing from a git checkout"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"On pnpm ≥ 10, the first `add` from git asks you to allow the build script — add the\npackage key prin"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ted by pnpm to the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml` under `allowBuilds`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Start dsh and open the composer.\n2. Click the microphone, then **Install** when prompted — the rs"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"-server binary and the\nmodel download in the background (one-time, ~180 MB for the default model).\n3"},{"id":"p22s3","text":". Record. Stop, and the transcript appears in your draft, ready to edit and send."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The server reclaims itself after 5 idle minutes and wakes in about 2 seconds on the\nnext recording."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Models"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `modelId` | Size | Languages | Mirrors |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `xasr-q8_0` *(default)* | 178 MB | auto, zh, en | ModelScope |\n| `sense-voice-small-q4_k` | 182 MB"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" | auto, zh, en, yue, ja, ko | HuggingFace, hf-mirror, ModelScope |\n| `funasr-nano-q4_k_m` | 692 MB "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"| auto, zh, en | HuggingFace, ModelScope |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Switching models"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Open the plugin's page in dsh and pick a model — the field is live: the next\nrecording downloads it "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"(after your consent) and subsequent recordings use it.\nAll catalog models live in the same cache, so"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" switching back to a previously\ndownloaded model needs no download."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"X-ASR is only published on ModelScope, so the HuggingFace mirror is not offered\nfor it; choosing an "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"unavailable mirror fails explicitly rather than falling back."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Advanced overrides"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Set these in the plugin page or in your profile's `cordis.patch.yml` (precedence\ntop to bottom):"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- `modelPath` — use a local GGUF file directly.\n- `modelDownloadUrl` — download from any HTTPS URL.\n"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"- `modelId` — a catalog entry."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| `managementMode` | `managed` | `managed`: the plugin downloads, spawns, and reclaims its server. `"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"external`: connect to an existing rs-server at `endpoint`. |\n| `modelId` | `xasr-q8_0` | Catalog mod"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"el to download. Editable live from the plugin page. |\n| `modelDownloadUrl` | — | Any HTTPS GGUF URL;"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" takes precedence over `modelId`. Editable live. |\n| `modelPath` | — | Local GGUF file; takes preced"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"ence over both. Editable live. |\n| `modelSha256` | — | Integrity hash for a manually specified model"},{"id":"p35s6","text":". Editable live. |\n| `dataRoot` | dsh home cache | Directory for the downloaded binary (`bin/`) and "},{"id":"p35s7","text":"models (`models/`). |\n| `endpoint` | `http://127.0.0.1:8080` | Server address in `external` mode (lo"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"opback or `allowedHosts` only). |\n| `serverBinaryPath` / `serverLibraryPath` | — | Use a self-provid"},{"id":"p35s9","text":"ed binary / shared-library directory. |\n| `languages` | `auto, zh, en` | Language hints advertised t"},{"id":"p35s10","text":"o the UI (catalog models use their own list). |\n| `stripControlTokens` | `true` | Remove SenseVoice-"},{"id":"p35s11","text":"style `<|…|>` markers from transcripts. |\n| `requestTimeoutMs` | `120000` | Per-transcription timeou"},{"id":"p35s12","text":"t. |\n| `maxAudioBytes` | 32 MiB | Recordings above this size are rejected before upload. |\n| `prepar"},{"id":"p35s13","text":"eTimeoutMs` / `downloadTimeoutMs` | `120000` / `1800000` | Budgets for startup and for one asset dow"},{"id":"p35s14","text":"nload. |\n| `idleTimeoutMs` | `300000` | Idle time before the managed server stops; `0` keeps it unti"},{"id":"p35s15","text":"l unload. |\n| `graceMs` | `1000` | Termination grace period. |\n| `maxLogBytes` | 64 KiB | Server out"},{"id":"p35s16","text":"put tail kept for diagnostics. |\n| `allowedHosts` | `[]` | Explicit whitelist for non-loopback `endp"},{"id":"p35s17","text":"for diagnostics. |\n| `allowedHosts` | `[]` | Explicit whitelist for non-loopback `endpoint` hosts. |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- **Download fails with `fetch failed`** — the host cannot reach the download origin.\nOn Windows, na"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"tive dsh does not read the system proxy; declare yours in\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
